N addplot.pkg
D 16 Jan 2025
U 101
d 'ADDPLOT': module to add twoway plot objects to an existing twoway graph
d 
d   addplot adds twoway plot objects to an existing twoway graph.
d This is useful if you want to add additional objects such as
d titles or extra data points to a twoway graph after it has been
d created. Most of what addplot can do, can also be done by
d rerunning the original graph command including additional options
d or plot statements. addplot, however, might be useful if you have
d to modify a graph for which you cannot rerun the original
d command, for example, because you only have the graph file but
d not the data that were used to create the graph. Furthermore,
d addplot can do certain things that would be difficult to achieve
d in a single graph command (e.g. customizing individual subgraphs
d within a by-graph). addplot also provides a substitute for some
d of the functionality of the graph editor.
d 
d KW: graphics
d KW: graph editing
d 
d Requires: Stata version 9
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20210818
d 
d Author: Ben Jann, University of Bern
d Support: email jann@@soz.unibe.ch
d 
f a\addplot.ado
f a\addplot.hlp
e
