N addest.pkg
D 12 Feb 2025
U 106
d `addest'. Add to or change stored estimation results.
d Allows the user to add to or change the results
d stored by Stata's {cmd:estimates store} command.
d These results can subsequently be recalled for display
d by e.g. the {cmd:estimates table} command or used in subsequent
d computations.  In addtion to adding macros to an
d existing set of results, {cmd:addest} can add to or alter
d the estimated coefficients or variance-covariance matrix.
d 
d by Mead Over, Center for Global Development
d http://www.cgdev.org/expert/mead-over
d 
d Version 1.11, Sep 25, 2020
d Requires Stata version 11.1 or later
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20200925
f a\addest.ado
f a\addest.sthlp
